	'Flowers are very graceful. If'
	R
	'you’re tired after work, how'
	R
	'about trying to look at some'
	R
	'flowers to soothe your soul?'
	\L_03719:
	ZH 1:
	'Need any flowers...?'
	R
	'Mr. Soldier, do you need any'
	R
	'flowers?'
	\L_03719:
	\L_0370c:
