	\L_03719:
	\L_0370c:
	\L_03664:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, um, thank you as always.'
	R
	'Oh yes, here...'
	\L_03719:
	\L_0370c:
	\L_0362c:
	ZH 1:
	'The girl took a flower that'
	R
	'was placed in her hair and'
	R
	'stuck it in the collar of'
	R
	'Rance’s armor.'
	\L_03719:
	\L_0370c:
	\L_03664:
	ZH 1:
	'I-It may not be much, but it’s'
	R
	'my thanks... My feelings.'
	R
	'Well, excuse me...'
	\L_03719:
	\L_0370c:
	\L_036c6:
	\L_035f4:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah, again? Hey...'
	\L_03719:
	\L_0370c:
	\L_0362c:
	ZH 1:
	'The girl blushed and ran from'
	R
	'the area after saying just'
	R
	'that.'
